[00:14.387]Where there's a will, there's a way, kind of beautiful
[00:18.460]And every night has its day, so magical
[00:22.036]And if there's love in this life, there's no obstacle
[00:25.646]That can't be defeated
[00:29.614]For every tyrant a tear for the vulnerable
[00:33.262]In every lost soul the bones of a miracle
[00:37.000]For every dreamer a dream we're unstoppable
[00:40.634]With something to believe in
[00:44.570]
[00:44.792]Monday left me broken
[00:47.944]Tuesday I was through with hopin'
[00:51.560]Wednesday my empty arms were open
[00:55.258]Thursday waiting for love, waiting for love
[01:00.020]Thank the stars it's Friday
[01:02.977]I'm burning like a fire gone wild on Saturday
[01:06.512]Guess I won't be coming to church on Sunday
[01:10.105]I'll be waiting for love
[01:12.892]Waiting for love to come around
[01:17.322]
[02:07.055]We are one of a kind, irreplaceable
[02:10.685]How did I get so blind and so cynical?
[02:14.436]If there's love in this life we're unstoppable
